{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tango District</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tango District is a casual puzzle style cyberpunk city-builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smart, react to corporate expansion and chase growth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City Builder That Plays Like a Puzzler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building placement matters. Position buildings to boost your city's reputation, unlock new building packs, and expand your city-state's area. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decisions That Shape Each Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=1060 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your city grows, events pop up based on your actions. Corporations move in, citizens react, and crimes ensue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices affect your funds, blowing them up or dwindling them down. As well as the power individual corporations hold in the city. Can you keep them in check? Or will you let them run wild?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corporate Power, Corporate Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations compete for influence over your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let them take over districts for powerful bonuses, or push back to stay independent. Their presence changes how areas behave and how you score \u2014 sometimes helping, sometimes boxing you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much control are you willing to give up?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City Built By You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building placement, event decisions, and corporate influence leave visible marks on your skyline. Some cities become tightly controlled corporate hubs. Others grow to be totalitarian hegemonies. While others still remain more independent. Strengths and limitations. Power and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back, explore the city you created, and find the best shots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Strategic Gameplay - Buy buildings in corporate packs, construct them on the city grid and resolve events using your funds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at Your Own Speed - Pause the game at any point to evaluate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Buildings and Technology \u2013 Each building has a different area of influence and synergies. Evolve them to grant greater bonuses to your reputation. And watch them evolve from simple edifices into temples to neon, metal and industry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the Government You Want (To Be) - Hundreds of text based encounters will force you to make tough decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized Urban Activity- Each play-through will feature different building unlocks, events, and results to your decisions. No two play-throughs will be quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Second Chances! -  Once you run out of funds, you face the threat of bankruptcy. If you try to spend more, your game will be over! The  threat of defeat adds importance and tension to every action. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860680?t=1772246026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860680?t=1772246026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/170c7a129d9a8f52d2887c7267035dfd74bf8487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772246026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/170c7a129d9a8f52d2887c7267035dfd74bf8487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772246026","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4098990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tango District</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tango District is a casual puzzle style cyberpunk city-builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smart, react to corporate expansion and chase growth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City Builder That Plays Like a Puzzler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/cd6037b15e587608d2c03fa41670260e.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building placement matters. Position buildings to boost your city's reputation, unlock new building packs, and expand your city-state's area. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decisions That Shape Each Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=1060 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/aa9784e6b6f3a2ecb5c811c630bf7389.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your city grows, events pop up based on your actions. Corporations move in, citizens react, and crimes ensue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices affect your funds, blowing them up or dwindling them down. As well as the power individual corporations hold in the city. Can you keep them in check? Or will you let them run wild?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corporate Power, Corporate Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/602f5b77ac1724a06ab43630d96dbb2a.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations compete for influence over your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let them take over districts for powerful bonuses, or push back to stay independent. Their presence changes how areas behave and how you score \u2014 sometimes helping, sometimes boxing you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much control are you willing to give up?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City Built By You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.poster.avif?t=1772246026\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.webm?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/extras/9c74645c2074449370db0f4317fc3d74.mp4?t=1772246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building placement, event decisions, and corporate influence leave visible marks on your skyline. Some cities become tightly controlled corporate hubs. Others grow to be totalitarian hegemonies. While others still remain more independent. Strengths and limitations. Power and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back, explore the city you created, and find the best shots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Strategic Gameplay - Buy buildings in corporate packs, construct them on the city grid and resolve events using your funds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at Your Own Speed - Pause the game at any point to evaluate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Buildings and Technology \u2013 Each building has a different area of influence and synergies. Evolve them to grant greater bonuses to your reputation. And watch them evolve from simple edifices into temples to neon, metal and industry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the Government You Want (To Be) - Hundreds of text based encounters will force you to make tough decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized Urban Activity- Each play-through will feature different building unlocks, events, and results to your decisions. No two play-throughs will be quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Second Chances! -  Once you run out of funds, you face the threat of bankruptcy. If you try to spend more, your game will be over! The  threat of defeat adds importance and tension to every action. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Maximiliano Rejlis"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860680/b87ce7279a2f8b373602b3ad95265560513893e3/header.jpg?t=1772246026","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3860680/1764891383/1eed8701a2366820cacf9041f4d2a4a0513ca2d6/1772244939/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772246026","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3860680/1764891383/1eed8701a2366820cacf9041f4d2a4a0513ca2d6/1772244939/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772246026","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3860680/1764891383/1eed8701a2366820cacf9041f4d2a4a0513ca2d6/1772244939/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772246026","id":257177719,"name":"Tango District Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177719/204c98a1075fe0b2a157628b5cc460af7cf46112/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772246026"}],"name":"Tango District","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Maximiliano Rejlis"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"ban